    "content": "<div>Hey <bc-attachment sgid=\"BAh7BkkiC19yYWlscwY6BkVUewdJIglkYXRhBjsAVEkiKWdpZDovL2JjMy9QZXJzb24vNDQ1ODgyOTE_ZXhwaXJlc19pbgY7AFRJIghwdXIGOwBUSSIPYXR0YWNoYWJsZQY7AFQ=--b7ebc3a79d1ebc2c8e04c68d2ee557a8c86e6c81\" content-type=\"application/vnd.basecamp.mention\"><figure>\n  <img data-avatar-for-person-id=\"44588291\" alt=\"Shay Berman\" title=\"Shay Berman, President at Digital Resource\" class=\"avatar\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://bc3-production-assets-cdn.basecamp-static.com/5471057/people/BAhpBANdqAI=--93f839777e9eaba5ef13b6c6e3184ac56d46a665/avatar\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">\n  <figcaption>\n    Shay\n  </figcaption>\n</figure></bc-attachment>!</div><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>10/25/25 </strong>- You approved a quote from Video Bulldog for $1,750 for a remote video Shoot for Athens Dental in GA. 10/25/25</li>\n<li>\n<strong>4/9/26</strong> - Client got back to us with shoot dates that work for them</li>\n<li>\n<strong>4/10/26</strong> - Video bulldog said they needed to requote the project due the time between when they quoted it and the time we reached back out. They ended up re-quoting for way more.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>4/14/26</strong> - I secured another vendor for the same price.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>5/8/26</strong> - Client provides new shoot date, and I confirm it with the vendor</li>\n<li>\n<strong>5/11/26</strong> - Date confirmed with vendor, and I was able to get our cost for the shoot down to $1,450.</li>\n</ul><div>Now I am just looking to see what next steps are regarding a vendor contract and payment.</div>",
